Goldbach Conjecture Segmented Verifier (GPU)
Usage: ./bin/legacy/goldbach_gpu3 <LIMIT> [SEG_SIZE] [P_SMALL]

Arguments:
  LIMIT     Max even integer to check (e.g., 1000000000)
  SEG_SIZE  (Optional) Even integers per segment. Default: 10,000,000
  P_SMALL   (Optional) GPU prime search bound. Default: 1,000,000

Flags:
  -h, --help  Show this help message
